          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Outcome</span><span class="info-stat-val">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/civil-rights-act-of-1964">Civil Rights Act of 1964</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/voting-rights-act-of-1965">Voting Rights Act of 1965</a> ended legal segregation and most barriers to Black voting in the South, though economic inequality and segregation in practice persisted</span></div>
